<!--meta {"lead": "A review quote shows one published review: its score and date, the customer's words, who wrote it for which service, and a way to report it.", "description": "Published review with score, date, quote, author and service, and a report action.", "pills": ["figure + blockquote", "Status: stable"], "variants": "with report action, without action (inside the report dialog)", "states": "static; report action hover and focus", "sources": ["pages/braider-profile/default", "dialogs/report-review/default"]} -->
<section class="ds-section" id="overview"><h2><a href="#overview">Overview</a></h2>
  <p>Use a review quote for each published review on a braider profile, and once, without its action, inside the Report a review dialog so the person can see what they are reporting. Reviews render as text: customer words never become markup (L2-039).</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="anatomy"><h2><a href="#anatomy">Anatomy</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-anatomy"><div class="ds-anatomy__figure" style="max-width: 32rem;"><figure class="review"><div class="review__header"><span class="rating"><span aria-hidden="true" class="rating__visual">{{icon:star|icon--sm icon--fill rating__star}}<span class="rating__value">5</span></span><span class="visually-hidden">Rated 5 out of 5</span></span><time class="review__date" datetime="2026-10-03">3 Oct 2026</time></div><blockquote class="review__quote"><p>The parts were so neat and Nia checked that nothing felt too tight.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="review__author">Maya Chen · Medium knotless braids</figcaption><div class="review__actions"><a class="btn btn--link btn--sm" href="../../mocks/dialogs/report-review/default.html">Report review<span class="visually-hidden"> by Maya Chen</span></a></div></figure></div>
    <ol class="ds-anatomy__list">
      <li><div><b>Header</b><small>Score (<a href="rating-summary.html">rating summary</a>, score only) and a <code>&lt;time&gt;</code>.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Quote</b><small><code>&lt;blockquote&gt;</code> in body text; long words wrap.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Author</b><small><code>&lt;figcaption&gt;</code>: name · service.</small></div></li>
      <li><div><b>Action</b><small>Link-style button "Report review", named with the author for screen readers.</small></div></li>
    </ol></div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="variants"><h2><a href="#variants">Variants</a></h2>
  {{example:[stack]With and without the report action.}}
<figure class="review"><div class="review__header"><span class="rating"><span aria-hidden="true" class="rating__visual">{{icon:star|icon--sm icon--fill rating__star}}<span class="rating__value">5</span></span><span class="visually-hidden">Rated 5 out of 5</span></span><time class="review__date" datetime="2026-09-26">26 Sep 2026</time></div><blockquote class="review__quote"><p>Quick, gentle and my braids lasted seven weeks.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="review__author">Kemi Adebayo · Passion twists</figcaption><div class="review__actions"><a class="btn btn--link btn--sm" href="../../mocks/dialogs/report-review/default.html">Report review<span class="visually-hidden"> by Kemi Adebayo</span></a></div></figure>
<figure class="review"><div class="review__header"><span class="rating"><span aria-hidden="true" class="rating__visual">{{icon:star|icon--sm icon--fill rating__star}}<span class="rating__value">5</span></span><span class="visually-hidden">Rated 5 out of 5</span></span><time class="review__date" datetime="2026-09-26">26 Sep 2026</time></div><blockquote class="review__quote"><p>Quick, gentle and my braids lasted seven weeks.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="review__author">Kemi Adebayo · Passion twists</figcaption></figure>
  {{/example}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sizes" data-na="One size; it fills its card column."><h2><a href="#sizes">Sizes</a></h2></section>

<section class="ds-section" id="states"><h2><a href="#states">States</a></h2>
  <p>The review itself is static. The report action follows the link button states (hover, focus, active). A review the viewer reported stays visible and unchanged; moderation happens elsewhere.</p>
  {{themes}}<figure class="review"><div class="review__header"><span class="rating"><span aria-hidden="true" class="rating__visual">{{icon:star|icon--sm icon--fill rating__star}}<span class="rating__value">4</span></span><span class="visually-hidden">Rated 4 out of 5</span></span><time class="review__date" datetime="2026-09-12">12 Sep 2026</time></div><blockquote class="review__quote"><p>Lovely result, ran a little over time.</p></blockquote><figcaption class="review__author">Zara Ali · Medium knotless braids</figcaption></figure>{{/themes}}
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="responsive"><h2><a href="#responsive">Responsive behaviour</a></h2>
  <ul><li>The header wraps the date under the score below about 16rem.</li><li>Quotes wrap anywhere, so pasted URLs never cause horizontal scroll.</li></ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="theming"><h2><a href="#theming">Theming</a></h2>
  <p>The divider uses <code>--color-border-default</code>; text roles follow the body, caption and body-small tokens in both themes.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="accessibility"><h2><a href="#accessibility">Accessibility</a></h2>
  <h3>Role and pattern</h3><p><code>&lt;figure&gt;</code> with <code>&lt;blockquote&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;figcaption&gt;</code>: the quote is associated with its author.</p>
  <h3>Keyboard</h3><table class="ds-table ds-keys"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Key</th><th scope="col">Action</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><kbd>Tab</kbd></td><td>Moves to "Report review".</td></tr><tr><td><kbd>Enter</kbd></td><td>Opens the report dialog; focus returns to the action when it closes.</td></tr></tbody></table>
  <h3>Focus</h3><p>The shared focus ring on the report action.</p>
  <h3>Labelling</h3><p>Each report action includes the author ("Report review by Maya Chen") so a list of them is distinguishable.</p>
  <h3>Contrast</h3>
  <div class="ds-example__canvas ds-example__canvas--stack" style="padding: 0; gap: var(--space-2);">
    {{pair:Quote|--color-fg-default|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}
    {{pair:Author|--color-fg-muted|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}
    {{pair:Date|--color-fg-subtle|--color-bg-surface|4.5}}
  </div>
  <h3>Motion</h3><p>None.</p>
  <h3>Touch</h3><p>The report action keeps a 44px target through button padding.</p>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="content"><h2><a href="#content">Content</a></h2>
  <ul><li>Dates as "3 Oct 2026".</li><li>The author is the reviewer's name as published; the service is the booked service name.</li><li>Never truncate a review; reviews are limited to 1000 characters.</li></ul>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="do-dont"><h2><a href="#do-dont">Do and don't</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-dodont">
    <figure class="ds-do"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><a class="btn btn--link btn--sm" href="../../mocks/dialogs/report-review/default.html">Report review<span class="visually-hidden"> by Maya Chen</span></a></div><figcaption>One report action per review.</figcaption></figure>
    <figure class="ds-dont"><div class="ds-example__canvas"><a href="../../mocks/dialogs/report-review/default.html">Report a review</a></div><figcaption>One link under all reviews, as in the first mocks: which review is reported?</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="tokens"><h2><a href="#tokens">Tokens</a></h2>
  <div class="ds-table-wrap"><table class="ds-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Part</th><th scope="col">Token</th><th scope="col">Light</th><th scope="col">Dark</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    {{tok:Divider|--color-border-default}}
    {{tok:Quote|--color-fg-default}}
    {{tok:Author|--color-fg-muted}}
    {{tok:Date|--color-fg-subtle}}
    {{tok:Padding / gap|--space-4|--space-2}}
  </tbody></table></div>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="code"><h2><a href="#code">Code</a></h2>
  <pre><code>&lt;figure class="review"&gt;
  &lt;div class="review__header"&gt;&lt;span class="rating"&gt;…&lt;/span&gt;&lt;time class="review__date" datetime="2026-10-03"&gt;3 Oct 2026&lt;/time&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;blockquote class="review__quote"&gt;&lt;p&gt;The parts were so neat…&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
  &lt;figcaption class="review__author"&gt;Maya Chen · Medium knotless braids&lt;/figcaption&gt;
  &lt;div class="review__actions"&gt;&lt;button class="btn btn--link btn--sm" type="button"&gt;Report review&lt;span class="visually-hidden"&gt; by Maya Chen&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/figure&gt;</code></pre>
</section>

<section class="ds-section" id="sources"><h2><a href="#sources">Sources</a></h2>
  <ul>{{mock:pages/braider-profile/default|reviews section}}{{mock:dialogs/report-review/default|the reported review, without action}}</ul>
  <p>Drift fixed: the first mocks used an unstyled <code>&lt;blockquote&gt;</code> with an inline <code>&lt;cite&gt;</code>, no score or date, and a single report link for all reviews.</p>
</section>
